  "details": "[Deepl Translate]\n\nThank you for implementing VRCRaycast.\n\nHowever, as it stands, the detection criteria for avatars are limited, making it impossible to deploy this feature to a broad user base. To resolve this, I request an update that automatically applies trigger colliders to avatars based on their humanoid shape during runtime.\n\nIf this is implemented, it will dramatically accelerate the development of avatar-based features utilizing VRCRaycast. I already have several ideas for such features.\n\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nTranslated with DeepL.com (free version)",
